Summary usage in collect_stream_events and attach is updated to handle last_truncated and last_seq correctly with new semantics; saturating_sub protects against zero next_seq. AttachmentState and run_authenticated_socket usages of last_seq and event collection are aligned. Clients will use since = next_seq - 1 when attaching, matching server expectations. Also, session_warning for buffer truncation in stream events is implemented.
